1
00:00:00,596 --> 00:00:04,126
Wow, this book is the best!

2
00:00:04,126 --> 00:00:07,230
[CONSTRUCTION NOISES]

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:10,230
Okay, what are those sounds?

4
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,540
Match! Do you know what those sounds are?

5
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:14,870
What sounds?

6
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:16,050
[SHATTER]
Oh, that?

7
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:19,020
Yeah. Come on, Match, let's find out!

8
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:19,830
Awhhh...

9
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:22,890
Hey! That's the ICRC!

10
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:23,430
What?

11
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:26,690
Uh, you know, the Ice Cube Recovery Center?

12
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:29,760
The place where Ice Cube is created when she dies?

13
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,460
Wow, coolio.

14
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,940
What's going on?

15
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,240
Come take a look.

16
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:37,700
Cool! It's Ice Cube, and she's shrinking!

17
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:39,700
No, she's falling.

18
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:49,090
♪ [INTRO PLAYS] ♪

19
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:51,090
Subtitles: Daniel Adam Valle

20
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,040
Hey, Snowball.

21
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:56,840
Remember how that Weird Speaker Box told
us our team would be getting a new player?

22
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:59,070
Yeah, of COURSE I remember!

23
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:00,790
COINY:
I wonder who it'll be?

24
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:02,790
Well, Coiny, you're about to find out.

25
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:05,210
Oh, and don't call me a Weird Speaker Box.

26
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:05,970
♪ Da-da-da-da-da-da ♪

27
00:01:05,970 --> 00:01:07,530
♪ Cake at Stake! ♪

28
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:11,360
So, the votes are in, and I've gathered
the six eliminated players here today.

29
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:15,830
One of you will be joining the Squashy Grapes,
who are impatiently waiting over there.

30
00:01:16,110 --> 00:01:19,370
The person rejoining the game gets
both this cake and this Win Token.

31
00:01:19,370 --> 00:01:21,230
Hey, that's not fair!

32
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:26,010
They do worse than us by getting
eliminated, and still, they get a Win Token?!

33
00:01:26,010 --> 00:01:29,650
Ha-ha! Stinks for you not to have a Win Token yet!

34
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:31,880
So, there was a total of twenty-eight votes.

35
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:34,400
Luckily for all of you, you
all got at least one vote.

36
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:34,600
- Woody...

37
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,210
- Ehhh?
- Woody...

38
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:37,830
I'm sorry to tell you this, but you only got one vote.

39
00:01:37,830 --> 00:01:39,830
You go back to the Tiny Loser Chamber.

40
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,830
WOODY:
EEEEEEEEHHHH!!

41
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:45,100
The TLC seems LARGER!

42
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:46,200
I enlarged it.

43
00:01:46,870 --> 00:01:49,830
With four votes each, there is a
three-way tie for third place.

44
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,240
Pin, you're one of the members of the tie.

45
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:53,450
You won't rejoin the game.

46
00:01:53,450 --> 00:01:54,840
What? That's CRAZY!

47
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,780
AAAAHHHH!

48
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,720
ANNOUNCER:
Spongy-Spongy, you too.

49
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,780
SPONGY:
UUUUUHHHHH!

50
00:01:58,780 --> 00:01:59,810
Also losing is...

51
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:04,040
If you re-eliminate me,

52
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:08,540
I'll crush you with my recently-refurbished
ANNOUNCER CRUSHER!!!

53
00:02:08,660 --> 00:02:10,410
Well, too bad for me. You're out.

54
00:02:10,410 --> 00:02:11,500
GRRRRRR!!

55
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:13,500
WAAAAAAOOOOUUAAAAH!

56
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:15,160
NO!

57
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:16,500
So, it's down to Needy-

58
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:17,920
DON'T call me Needy!

59
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,630
-and Blocky.

60
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:19,800
The Stabber and the Stabbable.

61
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:22,020
Don't call me STABBABLE!

62
00:02:22,210 --> 00:02:25,100
Now, rejoining the game
on the Squashy Grapes team is...

63
00:02:27,570 --> 00:02:28,520
...Blocky the Stabbable.

64
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:31,530
YEAH! But seriously, don't call me Stabbable.

65
00:02:31,530 --> 00:02:34,040
Needle, with a measly seven votes, you lose.

66
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,010
Aw, seri-

67
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:39,330
Yeah! A new team, guys!

68
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:43,320
Contestants, we have reached a new
stage in the Battle For Dream Island.

69
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,860
You are the final fifteen.

70
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:47,390
As a reward, you all get BFDI posters.

71
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:54,410
GRR! I was hoping for a BETTER reward!

72
00:02:54,530 --> 00:02:57,330
Okay, stash those away, because we gotta move on.

73
00:02:57,630 --> 00:03:01,860
Squishy Cherries, do you notice that you are
exactly half the size of the Squashy Grapes team?

74
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:05,670
Oh, ha-ha. You know, you don't have to rub it OIN!

75
00:03:05,670 --> 00:03:09,340
Well, that means the Grape team will permanently
be permanently split permanently in two,

76
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:11,830
permanently forming three
teams of five, permanently.

77
00:03:11,830 --> 00:03:15,000
Oh, my mint, are you W-ing serious?!

78
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,690
I liked being on the LARGER team.

79
00:03:17,690 --> 00:03:19,940
Hyuk-hyuk-doy, you better believe I'm serious.

80
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:21,880
Leafy and Rocky will choose the teams.

81
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:25,080
Why them?! Why not ME?!

82
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:27,620
Well, for one, they don't have archenemies.

83
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:30,200
Plus, their names are five letters long.

84
00:03:30,410 --> 00:03:31,750
I like the number five.

85
00:03:32,070 --> 00:03:33,640
So Leafy, choose first.

86
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:38,150
LEAFY:
Ah-ha! Ice Cube, come on down! You can be my ally!

87
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:39,760
Thanks for picking me!

88
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:42,420
Pencil wouldn't let me into her alliance.

89
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:44,960
That was almost a year ago, Icy.

90
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,140
Let it go!

91
00:03:46,140 --> 00:03:47,290
Rocky, your turn.

92
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:48,430
Rocky?

93
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:49,870
Come on, Rocky, Speak up!

94
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:54,170
Don't you know? Rocky forgot
how to talk in episode four.

95
00:03:54,170 --> 00:03:55,590
So how does he communicate?

96
00:03:55,590 --> 00:03:56,230
ROCKY:
Bleh!

97
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:57,630
He picks TB.

98
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:58,890
Teardrop, 'kay?

99
00:03:58,890 --> 00:03:59,510
Wha?

100
00:03:59,510 --> 00:04:01,480
Teardrop! Should she join or not?

101
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,890
She's got to join!

102
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:06,690
We'll pick Golf Ball because she and I are a DUO!

103
00:04:06,970 --> 00:04:07,960
Okay...

104
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:10,670
Out of the people left, Snowball seems the best.

105
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:13,610
I'm the BEST out of ALL people!

106
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:15,710
Coiny, Firey, or Blocky?

107
00:04:15,710 --> 00:04:16,690
Coiny!

108
00:04:16,690 --> 00:04:17,760
Hmm...

109
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:20,470
Blocky or Firey? Blocky or Firey?

110
00:04:20,470 --> 00:04:24,520
I'd say Blocky. I'm better friends with him!

111
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:28,090
Wait! But then Firey goes to my team,

112
00:04:28,090 --> 00:04:30,370
and he's just so dumb!

113
00:04:30,370 --> 00:04:32,270
I know you are, but what am I?

114
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:36,350
See? You're so dumb, you don't even know what you are!

115
00:04:36,870 --> 00:04:38,060
Name-choosing time.

116
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:42,800
Leafy, Icy, TD, SB, and Blocky, choose your name.

117
00:04:42,820 --> 00:04:45,360
You know, I've been a Squashy Grape for so long,

118
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:48,080
I think we should continue
to be the Squashy Grapes!

119
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:49,160
Sounds good?

120
00:04:51,470 --> 00:04:53,190
Uh...yeah!

121
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:54,540
Then that's your team name.

122
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:55,900
Okay, moving on.

123
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:59,560
Rocky, TB, GB, Coiny, and Firey, what's your name?

124
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:03,400
Ooh, ooh! I wanna be the Squashy Grapes, too!

125
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:04,570
No, NO!

126
00:05:04,570 --> 00:05:06,710
The others are already the Squashy Grapes!

127
00:05:06,710 --> 00:05:08,710
Our name has to be ANOTHER NAME!

128
00:05:08,710 --> 00:05:10,160
So then your team is Another Name.

129
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:10,600
Wait, I-

130
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,310
Let's go through our current teams.

131
00:05:12,410 --> 00:05:13,520
Squishy Cherries,

132
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,860
Squashy Grapes,

133
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:16,040
and Another Name.

134
00:05:16,350 --> 00:05:18,570
Um, Awkward Speaker Cube?

135
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:21,730
Last episode, you said TWO
people would be eliminated.

136
00:05:21,730 --> 00:05:22,860
What's that about?

137
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:26,500
Well, during the voting period, voters
will vote two people off the losing team.

138
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:29,470
Afterward, the winning team chooses
one of the two onto their team.

139
00:05:29,470 --> 00:05:30,910
Nothing happens to the middle team.

140
00:05:30,910 --> 00:05:34,880
Okay, sounds good, unusual talking rectangle!

141
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,940
Okay, enough talking. Let's get to it.

142
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:37,450
The ninth-

143
00:05:37,450 --> 00:05:39,130
Which IIIS?!

144
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,660
The ninth contest is a six-legged race.

145
00:05:44,890 --> 00:05:46,800
Here are ropes to tie your legs together.

146
00:05:46,860 --> 00:05:47,520
Go!

147
00:05:48,730 --> 00:05:51,320
Come on, Grapes! TIE UP!

148
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:54,880
LOOK! The Mushy Berries are already going!

149
00:05:58,530 --> 00:06:01,800
Ow! Aughuah! Ow! Agh! Ow! Aoouugh! Oo!

150
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:04,350
Ouughuuaagh! Blaah! BLAAH! BLAAAAAAH!

151
00:06:04,350 --> 00:06:05,540
BLAAAAAEEEEEGH!

152
00:06:07,710 --> 00:06:08,920
GRR!

153
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,580
AH!

154
00:06:09,580 --> 00:06:13,990
You SLOWPOKES are taking. TOO. LONG!

155
00:06:13,990 --> 00:06:16,790
Seriously, SB, CALM DOWN!

156
00:06:16,790 --> 00:06:18,470
Can't you at least help?

157
00:06:18,470 --> 00:06:21,010
Oh, I'll help alright!

158
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:26,470
Now you're all tied up. No need to thank!

159
00:06:27,690 --> 00:06:30,600
Wow, we're winning! That doesn't happen a lot!

160
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:32,090
Yeah, sure, Bubble.

161
00:06:32,090 --> 00:06:34,990
Uh, guys, make sure to avoid that tree.

162
00:06:34,990 --> 00:06:37,150
Ooh! Egh! Augh! Ack! Ooo! Eugh! Ow!

163
00:06:37,150 --> 00:06:37,560
OOF!

164
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,660
Ooh! Ow! Egh! Ack! Ooo! Augh! Eugh!

165
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,380
Aren't races like this great?

166
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:42,280
Yeah!

167
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:45,230
And if we could walk IN SYNCHRONY,

168
00:06:45,230 --> 00:06:47,400
IT WOULD BE EVEN BETTER!!!

169
00:06:48,180 --> 00:06:48,790
Bleh!

170
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:51,010
Hey! It slimed me!

171
00:06:51,010 --> 00:06:51,900
Euuugh...

172
00:06:52,270 --> 00:06:54,890
HNNNGH...

173
00:06:54,890 --> 00:06:56,590
UUUGH!

174
00:06:57,780 --> 00:06:58,680
Hnnngh!

175
00:06:58,860 --> 00:07:00,780
Wouldn't it be easier to-

176
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:02,560
Shu-SHUT IT!

177
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:07,080
HNNNNNNGH!

178
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:09,730
HNNNNNNNGH!

179
00:07:09,730 --> 00:07:10,840
Ughhh...

180
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:11,690
Hheeeehhhh...

181
00:07:12,810 --> 00:07:16,350
This-this is amazing! I mean, for so long,

182
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:18,790
Uh-we-we've been in last place,
and I-uh-I imagine that

183
00:07:18,790 --> 00:07:21,350
when we are finally in first
place, it'll be so magical!

184
00:07:21,780 --> 00:07:24,890
If we're quiet, they won't notice we're ahead.

185
00:07:24,890 --> 00:07:26,070
WE'RE AHEAD?!

186
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:28,970
- Quiet, you!
- Well, YOU'RE not so quiet!

187
00:07:29,210 --> 00:07:29,730
GASP!

188
00:07:29,730 --> 00:07:31,130
It's a TIGHTROPE!

189
00:07:31,130 --> 00:07:33,950
Ehh, I-I have a fear of heights...

190
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:36,060
- AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!

191
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,810
- Huh? Ah! The Names are ahead!
- AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!

192
00:07:38,810 --> 00:07:40,040
- We have to catch up!
- AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!

193
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,700
- AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!

194
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:43,180
They've spotted us! Go, GO!

195
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:45,180
Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up, HURRY UP, HURRY UP!!!

196
00:07:45,180 --> 00:07:47,350
The finish! It's right there!

197
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:48,320
Bleh!

198
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:50,940
WHOOOAAA!

199
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:51,710
OOF!

200
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,410
YOY!

201
00:07:53,410 --> 00:07:55,850
Yay. Squishy Cherries, you're team number winner.

202
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:57,980
You'll be expecting a new player next episode.

203
00:07:58,330 --> 00:08:00,360
Team Another Name, you're team number middle.

204
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,530
You don't win or lose.

205
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:05,360
But that means Ice Cube's team,
the Squashy Grapes, falls into last place.

206
00:08:05,490 --> 00:08:06,460
They are the losers.

207
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:10,180
So voters, choose just one of
the following people to vote off:

208
00:08:10,180 --> 00:08:12,240
Ice Cube, or those other four.

209
00:08:12,670 --> 00:08:15,330
The two most voted people will leave the Squashy Grapes.

210
00:08:15,540 --> 00:08:17,490
One will be chosen into the Squishy Cherries.

211
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,570
Hnnngh...

212
00:08:26,850 --> 00:08:28,680
Hnnnnngh...

213
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:31,120
So tired...

214
00:08:31,450 --> 00:08:33,430
Heeeeuuuuuugh...

215
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:36,480
Huuuuughhhhh...

216
00:08:40,820 --> 00:08:44,830
You know, when you fall into a
bottomless pit, you die of starvation.